| `6 Reviews/Team/` | Team sprint snapshot — separate daily file |
| `6 Reviews/Weekly/` | Weekly retro + Leadership OS scores |
| `7 Metrics & KPIs/` | WBR, MBR, QBR, Anomalies, Metric Definitions (SSOT) |
